bb-plugin-thread-card includes code adapted from two MIT-licensed bb plugins.

bb-plugin-retitle — https://github.com/chug2k/bb-plugin-retitle
  Adapted: package and test skeleton, the hidden helper-thread lifecycle
  (spawn → wait → output → stop → delete), the CLI pattern.

bb-recap — https://github.com/MacHatter1/bb-recap
  Adapted: timeline paging and transcript building, the incremental
  "previous summary + new turns" input, bb.storage.migrate use, the
  two-worker limiter.

Their license notices follow.

